  "shortDescription": "Over the past few weeks we've been engaged in small stage skirmishes with {TEAM_TAR.FactionDef.ShortName} in and around {TGT_SYSTEM.name}. The company commander must feel they can't continue their campaign because they've requested a duel to claim this local forward base. Little do they know that we've recently run out of supplies so we've very much taken them up on their offer. This is where you come in. We need you to win this for us, Commander.",
  "longDescription": "No ammo left? What kind of idiot set up their supply lines. Let's clean this duel up and cash in, Commander.",
  "salvagePotential": 4,
